    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Orbital Assault Force",
    "summary": "**[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)** goes to the models of **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units you pick as the Declare Battle Formations step starts. **TITANIC** units cannot be picked, and battle size caps how many you may pick:\n\n- Incursion: 2\n- Strike Force: 3\n- Onslaught: 4\n\nAttacks by an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** model of yours may re-roll **Wound rolls** of 1 during the turn it was placed on the battlefield, and also **Hit rolls** of 1 if it left a **DROP POD** by disembarking in that turn.",
